@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

<style>
activityDiagram {
  BackgroundColor #E8EAF6
  BorderColor #283593
  FontColor #1A237E
}
</style>

title **Food Rescue Platform (Replate) - Delivery & Dual-Party Handover Verification Workflow**

|Donor|
|Volunteer Driver|
|Replate System|
|Recipient NGO|

|Replate System|
start
:Dispatch Engine assigns nearest driver;
:Create Delivery record (status: DRIVER_ASSIGNED);

|Volunteer Driver|
:Receive Job Assignment Notification;
:Review Food Details, Pickup & Dropoff Stops;
:Accept Delivery Assignment;
:Click "Start Trip to Pickup";

|Replate System|
:Compute driving route via OSRM;
:Set Delivery status to PICKUP_STARTED;
:Broadcast Driver En-Route status;

|Volunteer Driver|
:Navigate to Donor Pickup Location;
:Arrive at Donor Premises;

|Donor|
:Inspect packaging, food temperature & hygiene;
:Hand over food containers to Driver;
:Verify actual quantity handed over;

|Volunteer Driver|
:Enter verified quantity in Mobile App;
:Request Donor digital signature;

|Donor|
:Sign digital handover declaration;

|Volunteer Driver|
:Submit Pickup Handover (POST /deliveries/{id}/pickup-complete);

|Replate System|
:Record Donor confirmation in HandoverRecord;
:UPDATE Delivery status = PICKED_UP;
:UPDATE Donation status = PICKED_UP;
:Calculate route to Recipient NGO facility;

|Volunteer Driver|
:Depart with secured food cargo;
:Stream live GPS location en-route;

|Recipient NGO|
:Track incoming delivery on live map;
:Prepare receiving bay & cold storage;

|Volunteer Driver|
:Arrive at Recipient NGO facility;
:Present food cargo for intake inspection;

|Recipient NGO|
:Inspect temperature, condition & seal integrity;
:Weigh intake quantity;

|Volunteer Driver|
:Input received quantity and condition notes;

|Recipient NGO|
if (Food accepted in good condition?) then (Yes)
  :Sign digital intake confirmation;
  |Volunteer Driver|
  :Submit Dropoff Handover (POST /deliveries/{id}/dropoff-complete);
  |Replate System|
  :Record Recipient confirmation in HandoverRecord;
  :Set Delivery status = DELIVERED;
  :Set Donation status = DELIVERED;
  :Deduct storage capacity from NGO;
  :Compute impact metric (kg rescued, CO2 avoided);
  :Generate tamper-proof SHA-256 audit log;
else (No / Discrepancy)
  :Note discrepancy / spoilage reasons;
  |Volunteer Driver|
  :Submit Partial / Discrepancy Report;
  |Replate System|
  :Set Delivery status = PARTIALLY_DELIVERED (or DRIVER_ISSUE);
  :Flag alert to Quality Assurance Operations;
endif

|Replate System|
:Set Vehicle availability = AVAILABLE;
:Broadcast completion event to all parties;

stop

@enduml
